## Interface: 20506, 16001
## Title: Wick's UI
## Notes: A full interface replacement for World of Warcraft: Forever and TBC Classic Anniversary. Action bars, unit frames, group frames, nameplates, auras, chat, minimap and skins, in the Wick look, with every part optional.
## Author: Wick
## Version: 0.10.3
## Dependencies: WickCore
## SavedVariables: WicksUIDB
## X-oUF: WicksUI_oUF
## X-Website: https://wicksmods.com
## X-License: MIT with trademark carve-out. Bundled libraries keep their own licenses, see Libs.
